 2481 2ABC ~            ; A = 0 if a = b, 1 if a < b, 2 if a > b, 3 if either is a NaN. Two zeros are equal whatever
 2482 2ABC ~            ; their signs; otherwise floats of one sign are ordered as their bits are, upside down for
 2483 2ABC ~            ; negative ones.
 2484 2ABC ~            ;
