 2708 2ABC ~            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 2709 2ABC ~            ; A product's or a quotient's operands, when both are normal numbers -- the common case, for
 2710 2ABC ~            ; which the general path's tests for NaNs, infinities, zeros and subnormals and its normalisation
 2711 2ABC ~            ; are all for nothing. Carry set if fpa or fpb is not one (an exponent field of 0 or 255), and
 2712 2ABC ~            ; then nothing is changed but fps, which the general path sets again. Otherwise, as that path
 2713 2ABC ~            ; would leave them: fps = the result's sign; the leading ones put into the significands, the low
