 4987 2BB0 ~            ; which shifted the multiplier and the product's high half through DE a bit at a time. A multiplier
 4988 2BB0 ~            ; below 256, which is what float's multiplication passes three times out of four, is the one
 4989 2BB0 ~            ; product, some 300 T-states.
